1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,255
Rates of change are derivatives with respect to time.

2
00:00:03,255 --> 00:00:09,309
A five metre ladder leans on a wall, and its foot is pulled away at two metres per second.

3
00:00:09,309 --> 00:00:16,406
The foot moves steadily, but watch the top: it starts slowly, then plunges faster and faster.

